const body = "<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ujxweovx alignfull uagb-is-root-container\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-zk9opa2h\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-utzizrp3 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h1 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">The Complete UK Blue Staffy Puppy Buying Guide: Find an Ethical Breeder, Avoid Scams &amp; Prepare Your Home</h1></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>From Ethical Staffy Breeders &amp; Health Checks to Lifelong Support: Everything You Need to Know to Welcome Your New Loyal Blue Staffy Puppy.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/buy-blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">buy staffordshire bull terrier</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-fsizbqzq\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-lstvv5ie alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-t5afnii0 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">How do I buy a Blue Staffy puppy in the UK?</h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-s5uf4rnb\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-meagdb4e uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Embarking on the journey to welcome a Blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppy into your UK home is an exciting and rewarding experience. The key to a smooth and responsible process lies in thorough preparation, whether you’re considering a <strong><a href=\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/findapet\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffordshire Bull Terrier for rehoming</a></strong> or selecting a companion from professional <strong>Staffy dog breeders</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-z9iv8vvg uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">To <a href=\"/buy-blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>buy a Blue Staffy puppy in the UK</strong></a> or find Staffies for adoption, you should begin by researching Health-tested, Kennel Club (KC) registered breeders who prioritise health testing for conditions like L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4. Always arrange to meet the puppy and its mother in their home environment to observe their temperament and living conditions. <br/><br/>Before choosing your puppy, it’s vital to learn about the breed’s health, temperament, and unique needs. Learn about <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier characteristics, screening, and genetic health information at</strong><a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/search/breeds-a-to-z/breeds/terrier/staffordshire-bull-terrier/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong> The Kennel Club</strong></a> provides an excellent foundation for understanding what to expect from your new Blue Staffy.<br/><br/>Ensure all necessary paperwork, including KC registration and health certificates, is provided, and plan for safe collection or DEFRA-approved delivery to welcome your new family member</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-0nadvkwb alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-bloc