192C256 156.7 227.3 128 192 128C156.7 128 128 156.7 128 192C128 227.3 156.7 256 192 256z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Birmingham</strong></h4></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Where can I <a href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-birmingham/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">find purebred Blue Staffy puppies for sale</a> from a trusted breeder near the Birmingham Bullring?</p>\n<p>We aim to be <strong>premier blue Staffy breeders with puppies available now,</strong> or offer clear <strong>blue Staffy puppy waiting list information</strong>.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-48d2084c wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A joyful family with two children and a Blue Staffy dog standing in front of a stylized map of the United Kingdom.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"562\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/uk-family-blue-staffy.webp\" srcset=\"/images/uk-family-blue-staffy.webp 604w\" width=\"604\"/></figure></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-cea53ef7 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-star-rating uagb-block-b0dd0f87\"><p class=\"uag-star-rating__title\">The Best Decision We Ever Made</p><div class=\"uag-star-rating\" title=\"5/5\"><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-08a071cc uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">“Our experience with BlueStaffyUK.uk was flawless. From the initial inquiry to the safe delivery of our little boy, Max, they were supportive every step of the way. Max is incredibly well-socialised and adapted to our home instantly. Their ongoing advice has been invaluable. We highly recommend them to anyone looking for a truly special Blue Staffy.”</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-a75984fe uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-image-content\"><img alt=\"Adorable litter of healthy blue staffy pups for sale, currently playing in a clean, professional environment.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/healthy-blue-staffy-pups-for-sale-certified.webp\" srcset=\"/images/healthy-blue-staffy-pups-for-sale-certified.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>— <em>Emily &amp; David, London</em></strong></p></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div>\n<div id=\"breeder-questions\">\n<h2>🐾 15 Questions to Ask Any Blue Staffy Breeder Before You Buy</h2>\n<p>Print this checklist and use it on every breeder visit. An ethical breeder will welcome every question. A bad one will dodge them.</p>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:22px;line-height:1.9;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:0.94rem;\">\n<li><strong>Are both parents KC-registered?</strong> Ask to see the original KC registration certificates, not photocopies.</li>\n<li><strong>Can I see the L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4 DNA test results?</strong> Both parents should be clear or carrier-to-clear (never carrier-to-carrier).</li>\n<li><strong>Can I see the mother (dam) with the puppies?</strong> If the mother is not present, walk away. This is the single biggest red flag for a puppy farm.</li>\n<li><strong>How many litters does the dam have per year?</strong> The KC recommends no more than 4 litters per dam lifetime. More than 2 per year is a warning sign.</li>\n<li><strong>Have the puppies been vet-checked?</strong> Ask for the vet practice name and check date.</li>\n<li><strong>What vaccinations have they received?</strong> Puppies should have at least their first vaccination before leaving at 8 weeks.</li>\n<li><strong>Have they been microchipped?</strong> UK law requires microchipping before sale.</li>\n<li><strong>What worming programme have they been on?</strong> Puppies should be wormed at 2, 5, and 8 weeks minimum.</li>\n<li><strong>Do you offer a health guarantee or purchase contract?</strong> Reputable breeders provide written contracts covering hereditary conditions.</li>\n<li><strong>Have the puppies been socialised with children, other dogs, and household noises?</strong> The critical socialisation window is 3-12 weeks.</li>\n<li><strong>What food are they currently eating?</strong> A good breeder provides a feeding schedule and a supply of current food.</li>\n<li><strong>Can I have references from previous buyers?</strong> Confident ethical breeders connect you with past puppy families.</li>\n<li><strong>What happens if I can no longer keep the puppy?</strong> Ethical breeders will always take a puppy back rather than let it go to a rescue.</li>\n<li><strong>Are you a member of the Staffordshire Bull Terrier Club?</strong> Club membership shows commitment to breed standards.</li>\n<li><strong>Can I visit the puppies more than once before deciding?</strong> Any pressure to \"buy now or lose your spot\" is a manipulation tactic.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>🚩 Ethical Breeder vs Puppy Farm — Red Flags &amp; Green Flags</h2>\n<p>Thousands of UK buyers unknowingly buy from puppy farms each year. Here is how to tell the difference at a glance.</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"stack-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.88rem;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#1a3a5c;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Topic</th>\n<th style=\"background:#16a34a;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">✅ Ethical Breeder</th>\n<th style=\"background:#dc2626;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">Meeting location</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Invites you to their home to see the litter</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Offers to meet in a car park or deliver to you</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">Mother present?</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Dam is present, healthy, and relaxed</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\"She is at the vet\" or \"not available today\"</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">KC paperwork</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Original KC registration shown, name matches</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Vague about paperwork, says \"it is in the post\"</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">DNA health tests</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">L-2-HGA &amp; HC-HSF4 certificates shown</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\"They are naturally healthy, no tests needed\"</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">Price pressure</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">No urgency, happy for you to think it over</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\"Another family wants this puppy today\"</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">Microchip</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Done, can show certificate and chip number</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Not done, or \"you can do it yourself\"</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">Purchase contract</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Written contract with health guarantee</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Cash only, no paperwork, no receipts</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Topic\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;font-weight:600;\">After-sale support</td><td data-label=\"✅ Ethical Breeder\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;\">Gives phone number, checks in after collection</td><td data-label=\"🚩 Puppy Farm / Scam\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;\">Unreachable after money changes hands</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"cost-breakdown\">\n<h2>💷 True Cost of a Blue Staffy in Year 1 — Full UK Budget</h2>\n<p>The puppy price is just the beginning. Here is an honest breakdown of what to budget in your first year so there are no surprises.</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"stack-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.88rem;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#1a5fa8;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Cost Item</th>\n<th style=\"background:#1a5fa8;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\">Typical Range</th>\n<th style=\"background:#1a5fa8;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Notes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">🐶 Puppy price</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£850 – £1,200</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">KC-registered ethical breeders (avoid under £500)</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">🏥 Vet bills Year 1</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£300 – £600</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">2nd vaccination, booster, neutering, check-ups</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">🛡️ Pet insurance</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£240 – £600 /yr</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Lifetime cover recommended; Staffies are generally healthy</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">🍖 Food</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£300 – £700 /yr</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">High-quality kibble or raw diet; Staffies eat well</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">🛏️ Equipment (one-off)</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£150 – £400</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Crate, bed, harness, collar, ID tag, bowls, toys, lead</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">🎓 Puppy training classes</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£80 – £250</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">6-8 week KC Good Citizen course highly recommended</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\"><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-weight:600;\">💅 Grooming</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;\">£50 – £120 /yr</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Short coats mostly DIY; occasional nail trims</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"Cost Item\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;font-weight:700;color:#1a5fa8;\">📊 First-year total</td><td data-label=\"Typical Range\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;color:#1a5fa8;\">£1,970 – £3,870</td><td data-label=\"Notes\" style=\"padding:9px 14px;color:#555;\">Ongoing years £900 – £2,000 (food + insurance + vet)</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n</div>\n<p>⚠️ Always set aside a £500–£1,000 emergency vet fund regardless of insurance.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>📋 Your First 30 Days with a Blue Staffy Puppy — Complete Checklist</h2>\n<p>The first month sets the foundation for your puppy's entire life. Follow this week-by-week timeline to get it right.</p>\n<div>\n<h3>Week 1 — Settling In</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;color:#333;\">\n<li>Keep the house calm, limit visitors for the first 3 days</li>\n<li>Set up crate in a quiet corner with a worn item of your clothing</li>\n<li>Feed the same food as the breeder for at least 7 days</li>\n<li>Establish a toilet routine, take outside every 2 hours and after meals</li>\n<li>Register with a local vet within 48 hours</li>\n<li>Book 2nd vaccination appointment (usually 10-12 weeks)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Week 2 — First Routines</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;color:#333;\">\n<li>Begin name recognition training (5-minute sessions, 3x daily)</li>\n<li>Introduce \"sit\" using reward-based methods only</li>\n<li>Start handling exercises for ears, paws, and mouth to prepare for vet visits</li>\n<li>Carry puppy outdoors to experience sounds and smells before second vaccination</li>\n<li>Contact insurance provider, cover should start Day 1</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Week 3 — Socialisation Begins</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;color:#333;\">\n<li>Puppy vaccination complete, begin controlled outdoor walks (5 mins per month of age)</li>\n<li>Introduce to vaccinated, friendly adult dogs</li>\n<li>Expose to traffic, children, cyclists positively and at a distance</li>\n<li>Book puppy training class (KC Good Citizen programme)</li>\n<li>Start \"leave it\" and \"come\" commands</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Week 4 — Building Confidence</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;color:#333;\">\n<li>First puppy training class attended</li>\n<li>Introduce alone time, start with 5 minutes and build to 1 hour over the month</li>\n<li>Weigh puppy and adjust food portions accordingly</li>\n<li>Begin introducing car travel with short positive trips</li>\n<li>Review toilet training progress, accidents indoors should be reducing</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>✅ You Have Done Your Research — Now Meet Our Puppies</h2>\n<p>BlueStaffyUK are KC-aware ethical breeders with full L-2-HGA &amp; HC-HSF4 DNA testing, written purchase contracts, and lifetime support. BETH (£1,100), KANE (£1,000), ALIS (£1,200) and KOBE (£850) are available now.</p>\n<a href=\"/buy-staffy-puppies-for-sale-uk/\" style=\"background:#fff;color:#1a5fa8;font-weight:800;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;margin:0 8px 10px;\">🐶 View Available Puppies</a>\n<a href=\"/#contact-form\" style=\"background:transparent;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:0 8px 10px;\">📋 Make an Enquiry</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-015d5a34 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-06bd1075\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-630ed8b9 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Why Choose BlueStaffyUK.uk?</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>As <strong>KC-registered blue Staffy breeders with clear health tests</strong>, we stand by our commitment to excellence. Official KC-approved <a href=\"https://www.laboklin.co.uk/laboklin/showGeneticTest.jsp?testID=8712\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4 DNA testing via Laboklin</a>. Our <strong>bluestaffyuk champion bloodline</strong> ensures not only stunning aesthetics but also sound temperament and health. We encourage you to read <strong>bluestaffyuk reviews</strong> and see why families trust us.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-3760ec48 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Adopting a Blue Staffy Puppy vs Buying From a Breeder UK</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>While <strong>adopting a blue Staffy puppy vs buying from a breeder</strong> is a personal choice, buying from a purebred breeder like <strong>BlueStaffyUK.uk</strong> provides known lineage, guaranteed health testing, early socialisation, and lifelong support, offering peace of mind that a rescue might not always provide regarding background.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-c30e9e54 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">How to Buy Your Blue Staffy Puppy from BlueStaffyUK.uk</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Our process for <strong><a href=\"/blog/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">how to buy a blue Staffy puppy</a></strong> is straightforward:</p>\n<p></p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/blue-staffy-uk-breeders/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Discover Our Process</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 278.6l-160 160C272.4 444.9 264.2 448 256 448s-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25L338.8 288H32C14.33 288 .0016 273.7 .0016 256S14.33 224 32 224h306.8l-105.4-105.4c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0l160 160C451