ding=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/ready-to-welcome-blue-staffy-infographic.webp\" srcset=\"/images/ready-to-welcome-blue-staffy-infographic.webp 512w\" width=\"512\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-z9rvwtzf\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5bsyfdv3 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Ready to Welcome Your Blue Staffy?</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We hope this guide has provided valuable insights into owning a Blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier. For specific questions about <strong>how much a blue Staffy puppy costs from a pedigree breeder?</strong> Or to discuss <strong>bluestaffyuk puppy price</strong>, please use our True Cost of Owning a <a href=\"#cost-breakdown\">Blue Staffy Calculator</a> or contact us directly.</p>\n<p>We are always happy to help you <strong>secure my blue Staffy puppy</strong> and embark on this wonderful journey. <strong>Contact <a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BlueStaffyUK.uk Today to Inquire</a> About Your Next Staffy pup!</strong></p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-a84eb61e uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Be the First to Know: Get Puppy Availability Alerts! Can’t find your perfect Blue Staffy puppy available right now? Don’t miss out on our upcoming litters! Join our exclusive waiting list and be the first to receive notifications as soon as new Blue Staffy puppies are available for their forever homes. </p>\n<p>By signing up, you’ll receive: Early Access – Be notified before general announcements. Litter Updates: Information on expected birth dates and puppy details.Direct Contact: A direct line to inquire about specific puppies. Don’t wait – your future Blue Staffy companion could be just an alert away!</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-buttons uagb-buttons__outer-wrap uagb-btn__default-btn uagb-btn-tablet__default-btn uagb-btn-mobile__default-btn uagb-block-y0dadgnh\"><div class=\"uagb-buttons__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-buttons-child uagb-buttons__outer-wrap uagb-block-ca69dc2e wp-block-button\"><div class=\"uagb-button__wrapper\"><a aria-label=\"\" class=\"uagb-buttons-repeater wp-block-button__link\" href=\"#contact-us\" rel=\"follow noopener\" role=\"button\" target=\"_self\"><div class=\"uagb-button__link\">Fill the form below</div><span class=\"uagb-button__icon uagb-button__icon-position-after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focussable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 278.6l-160 160C272.4 444.9 264.2 448 256 448s-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25L338.8 288H32C14.33 288 .0016 273.7 .0016 256S14.33 224 32 224h306.8l-105.4-105.4c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0l160 160C451.1 245.9 451.1 266.1 438.6 278.6z\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-0nilffsm alignfull uagb-is-root-container\" id=\"contact-us\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\"> <div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container alignfull uagb-is-root-container bsuk-contact-form-wrap\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-card\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-header\">\n<h2>📋 You've Done Your Research — Now Reserve Your Puppy</h2>\n<p>Fill in your details below and we'll be in touch within 24 hours</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-body\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-form